<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - LSI Logic EPS view raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - LSI Logic EPS view raised.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- SoundView Financial Group analyst Erach Desai said in a research note he raised his 1997 fiscal year earnings estimate for LSI Logic Corp to $1.45 per share from $1.39 and the fiscal 1998 view to $1.85 from $1.75.</p>
<p>-- He also reiterated his short-term buy rating and the long-term rating is unchanged at hold.</p>
<p>-- LSI shares were off 3/4 to 38-5/8 in norning New York Stock Exchange trade.</p>
</text>
